## Register a module

Create a companion plugin file with the following example. The module is enabled by default and displays an administrator-only notice so you can verify initialization without changing store data.

```
<?php
/**
 * Plugin Name: Example WooCommerce AI Module
 *
 * @package Example_Woo_AI_Module
 */

namespace Example_Woo_AI_Module;

add_action(
	'woocommerce_ai_register_modules',
	function ( $registry ) {
		if ( ! interface_exists( 'WooCommerceAI\\Module\\ModuleInterface' ) ) {
			return;
		}

		$module = new class() implements \WooCommerceAI\Module\ModuleInterface {
			/**
			 * Check whether WooCommerce is available.
			 *
			 * @return bool Whether the module can initialize.
			 */
			public static function is_available(): bool {
				return class_exists( 'WooCommerce' );
			}

e can initialize.
			 */
			public static function is_available(): bool {
				return class_exists( 'WooCommerce' );
			}

			/**
			 * Register the example administrator notice.
			 *
			 * @return void
			 */
			public function init(): void {
				add_action(
					'admin_notices',
					function () {
						if ( current_user_can( 'manage_options' ) ) {
							echo '<div class="notice notice-info"><p>' . esc_html__( 'The example WooCommerce AI module is running.', 'example-woo-ai-module' ) . '</p></div>';
						}
					}
				);
			}
		};

		$registry->register(
			'example_module',
			$module,
			array(
				'option'      => 'wcai_example_module_enabled',
				'title'       => 'Example module',
				'description' => 'A test module that displays an admin notice.',
				'default'     => 'yes',
			)
		);
	}
);
```

## Add product details or a barcode

The template also supports 
```
{ticket_id}
```

 for the ticket ID, 
```
{post_title}
```

 for the ticket title, 
```
{post_content}
```

 for the product description, 
```
{product_price}
```

 for the formatted product price, and 
```
{product_sku}
```

 for its SKU.

When WooCommerce Order Barcodes is active, select **Include barcode** to add the barcode below the printed ticket content. You don’t need to add a barcode placeholder for that option.

### Examples

```
// Add an "Anniversary" event type.
add_filter( 'registry_and_cart_toolkit_event_types', function ( $types ) {
	$types['anniversary'] = __( 'Anniversary', 'your-textdomain' );
	return $types;
} );

// Treat bank transfer and cheque like cash on delivery for contributions.
add_filter( 'registry_and_cart_toolkit_offline_payment_methods', function ( $methods ) {
	return array_merge( $methods, array( 'bacs', 'cheque' ) );
} );

// Keep the "gift-cards" category off registries.
add_filter( 'registry_and_cart_toolkit_product_can_be_added_to_registry', function ( $can_add, $product ) {
	return $can_add && ! has_term( 'gift-cards', 'product_cat', $product->get_id() );
}, 10, 2 );
```

