**Payment behavior**

Xero accepts payments only for authorized invoices. Set **Send Payments** to **Manual**, review and authorize each draft in Xero, then record or send the payment through the accounting workflow you use. Fully refunded draft invoices cannot be voided automatically by the extension. Xero requires draft invoices to be deleted rather than voided, so they remain in Xero unless deleted separately.

