The input and output schemas are provided below as a reference, but they can also be achieved using [Abilities API methods](https://developer.wordpress.org/reference/classes/wp_ability/). For example:

```
$ability = wp_get_ability( 'woocommerce-memberships/plans-get' );

echo '<pre>';

echo json_encode($ability->get_input_schema(), JSON_PRETTY_PRINT);
echo json_encode($ability->get_output_schema(), JSON_PRETTY_PRINT);

echo '</pre>';
```

