### Prevent “Sold Individually” products with different add-ons from being purchased

By default, a “Sold Individually” product can be added multiple times to the cart, if a different set of add-ons is selected. To ensure that “Sold Individually” products can be added only a single time to the cart, regardless of the selected add-ons, use the following snippet:

```
<?php

add_filter( 'woocommerce_add_to_cart_validation', 'check_if_product_exists_in_cart', 10, 2 );

function check_if_product_exists_in_cart( $is_valid, $product_id ) {
    $product = wc_get_product( $product_id );

    if ( $product->is_sold_individually() ) {
        $cart_contents = WC()->cart->get_cart_contents();

        foreach ( $cart_contents as $cart_item ) {
            if ( $product_id === $cart_item['product_id'] ) {
                $is_valid = false;

                $notice = sprintf(
                    '<a href="%s" class="button wc-forward">%s</a> %s',
                    wc_get_cart_url(),
                    __( 'View cart', 'woocommerce' ),
                    sprintf( __( 'You cannot add another \"%s\" to your cart.', 'woocommerce' ), $product->get_name() )
                );

sprintf( __( 'You cannot add another \"%s\" to your cart.', 'woocommerce' ), $product->get_name() )
                );

                wc_add_notice( $notice, 'error' );

                break;
            }
        }
    }

    return $is_valid;
}
```

