### PHP example

The following example retrieves upcoming vacation Schedules using WooCommerce REST API credentials:

```
function mypreview_get_vacation_schedules() {

	$consumer_key    = 'your_consumer_key';
	$consumer_secret = 'your_consumer_secret';
	$endpoint        = 'https://your-domain.com/wp-json/store-vacation/v1/schedule?funnel=upcoming';

	$response = wp_remote_get(
		$endpoint,
		array(
			'headers' => array(
				'Authorization' => 'Basic ' . base64_encode( $consumer_key . ':' . $consumer_secret ),
				'Content-Type'  => 'application/json',
			),
		)
	);

	if ( is_wp_error( $response ) ) {
		return $response;
	}

	$status_code = wp_remote_retrieve_response_code( $response );

	if ( 200 !== $status_code ) {
		return new WP_Error(
			'store_vacation_api_error',
			'Store Vacation REST API request failed.',
			array( 'status' => $status_code )
		);
	}

	$response_body = wp_remote_retrieve_body( $response );

	return json_decode( $response_body, true );
}
```

