### The “Chef’s Picks” subscription product with add-ons

- The subscriptions need to be charged in advance of the upcoming week in a synchronized fashion, so we will first enable the [Align Subscription Renewal Day](https://woocommerce.com/document/subscriptions/renewal-synchronisation/#renewal-synchronization-settings) option in **WooCommerce > Settings > Subscriptions**;
- We will then [create the subscription product](https://woocommerce.com/document/subscriptions/store-manager-guide/#section-1) and set it to renew weekly on the day of our choosing — this means that a new subscriber will be automatically moved to the next renewal cycle;
- As for the dessert and juice add-ons, we will add them directly to the product’s settings and [use checkboxes](https://woocommerce.com/document/product-add-ons/#section-6) to clearly present the options;

![](https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/image-243.png?w=650)

### The “Weekly menu” composite product

- We’ll [create a composite product](https://woocommerce.com/document/composite-products/composite-products-configuration/#adding-components) with the weekdays as components and the meals as component options;
- As we want to give customers the flexibility to pick meals for the whole week or just one day, we will [make each component optional](https://woocommerce.com/document/composite-products/composite-products-configuration/#basic-settings), have no default meal selection, and be priced individually;
- We will use radio buttons to clearly present the two options for each day.

![](https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/image-243.png?w=650)

### Getting paid

- The WooPayments extension will handle the credit card payments for the subscription product while Woo Subscriptions will schedule the charges to occur automatically at every renewal day;
- For non subscription products, the WooPayments extension will provide [alternative options on top of the credit card](https://woocommerce.com/document/woopayments/payment-methods/) one for additional flexibility;
- After your account is fully onboarded, you can set it to make [deposits to your bank account](https://woocommerce.com/document/woopayments/payouts/change-payout-schedule/) daily, weekly, or monthly.

