Here is an example using a custom field that was added with the [Checkout Field Editor extension](https://woocommerce.com/products/woocommerce-checkout-field-editor/). As of version 1.1.8 the code is no longer required for the extension’s own fields, but the code is still valid for custom fields created in other ways.

